{"page":"CSNK1D","gene":"CSNK1D","accession":"P48730","protein":"Casein kinase I isoform delta","length":415,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"P48730-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000314028.11"],"refseq":["NM_001893.6"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001884.2"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-P48730-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P48730-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":81,"plddt":[[0,1],[50,1],[70,5],[90,8],[70,6],[90,22],[70,4],[90,27],[70,1],[90,216],[70,3],[50,8],[70,12],[50,5],[0,22],[50,2],[0,1],[50,1],[0,69],[50,1]]}},"features":[{"type":"Domain","start":9,"end":277,"description":"Protein kinase"},{"type":"Binding site","start":15,"end":23,"description":"ATP"},{"type":"Binding site","start":38,"end":38,"description":"ATP"},{"type":"Active site","start":128,"end":128,"description":"Proton acceptor"},{"type":"Region","start":278,"end":364,"description":"Centrosomal localization signal (CLS)"},{"type":"Region","start":317,"end":342,"description":"Autoinhibitory"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":328,"end":328,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":331,"end":331,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":370,"end":370,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":375,"end":375,"description":"Omega-N-methylarginine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":382,"end":382,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":383,"end":383,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":384,"end":384,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":407,"end":407,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":411,"end":411,"description":"Phosphoserine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Monomer (PubMed:22168824, PubMed:23106386). Component of the circadian core oscillator, which includes the CRY proteins, CLOCK, or NPAS2, ARTNL/BMAL1 or ARTNL2/BMAL2, CSNK1D and/or CSNK1E, TIMELESS and the PER proteins (By similarity). Interacts with DNMT1 and MAP1A (By similarity). Interacts directly with PER1 and PER2 which may lead to their degradation (PubMed:11165242). Interacts with MAPT/TAU (PubMed:14761950). Interacts with SNAPIN (By similarity). Interacts with DBNDD2 (PubMed:16618118). Interacts with AKAP9/AKAP450; this interaction promotes centrosomal subcellular location (PubMed:12270714). Binds to tubulins in mitotic cells upon DNA damage (PubMed:10826492). Interacts with GJA1 (PubMed:12270943). Interacts with DDX3X; this interaction enhances CSNK1D kinase activity in vitro, but it is unclear whether this interaction is physiologically relevant (PubMed:29222110). Interacts with CSNK1A, CSNK1B, CSNK1E and CSNK1H (via SACK1 domain) (PubMed:29789297)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"P48730-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":409,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000392334.7"],"refseq":["NM_139062.4"],"refseqProteins":["NP_620693.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,399]],"edits":[{"start":400,"end":415,"original":"IPGRVASSGLQSVVHR","replacement":"NSIPFEHHGK","added":10}],"missing":0,"replaced":16,"novel":10,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[13,0,1],[14,0,1]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-P48730-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P48730-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":81.7,"plddt":[[0,1],[50,1],[70,5],[90,8],[70,6],[90,22],[70,4],[90,244],[70,3],[50,7],[70,14],[50,5],[0,21],[50,1],[0,2],[50,1],[0,62],[50,2]],"losingConfidence":0}}],"ensemblGenes":["ENSG00000141551.16"],"unmapped":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[]},"coding":{"genes":1,"gencode":6,"mapped":2},"explorer":{"gene":null,"isoforms":"CSNK1D"},"locus":"chr17:82242667-82273706","exons":{"transcript":"ENST00000314028.11","first":1,"junctions":[76,187,336,565,736,885,1057,1197]},"structures":{"P48730-1":{"transcript":"ENST00000314028.11","st